issue.body:
## Add smooth horizontal scroll on board 🖱️

File: client/src/components/Board/KanbanBoard.jsx

Board scrolls horizontally but it's 
instant and jarring 💀 fr!!

Fix: add scroll behavior to board div:
// in index.css:
.board-scroll {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  scrollbar-width: thin;
  scrollbar-color: #2a2a2f transparent;
}

// in KanbanBoard.jsx board div:
className="board-scroll flex gap-4 p-4 
  overflow-x-auto h-full"

~4 lines across 2 files!
No backend needed 🎯
